[en.FOCUS_C09_ECO_WAR]
Currency Wars

[en.FOCUS_C09_ECO_WAR_desc]
Sire’s Hollow is an insignificant little town, so forget about becoming a vast empire or a military power, and instead control the lifeblood of Equestria, the most vital thing of all - It’s the economy, stupid! Real wars are not fought with guns and bombs, but with interest rates and monetary policy.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_ECO_WAR]
货币战争

[zh.FOCUS_C09_ECO_WAR_desc]
名流谷是一个不起眼的小镇，因此，干脆放弃成为一个庞大帝国或是军事霸权的想法，让名流谷从根本上控制小马利亚的命脉——蠢蛋，关键是经济！真正的战争不是用枪支和炸弹，而是用利率和货币政策。

